Patch `pipeline.lower_process_ir_to_cfg` to raise a unique test-only `ProcessIRCompileError` sentinel. Public compile must still execute its new reparse and `validate_body_capabilities`; the sentinel marks successful passage through the compile-side grammar boundary without introducing symbol/semantic failures.

